    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 37,
      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated and compassionate veterinary clinicians"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners praise vets like Alan, Dominic, and Gav, alongside the welcoming reception and nursing team, for their thorough examinations and empathetic care. Longstanding clients highlight the team's willingness to go the extra mile during difficult illnesses. While two clients reported delays or unhelpful consultations, feedback remains overwhelmingly positive."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 23,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for dogs and cats"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently remark on the thoughtful, gentle care provided to both dogs and cats during health checks and treatments. Reviewers note that nervous puppies, elderly pets, and rescue animals are treated with genuine patience and affection. Handlers appreciate that clinicians take the time to keep pets calm and comfortable throughout consultations."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Effective surgeries and clinical treatments"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents report successful outcomes for complex procedures, including growth removals, urgent stomach surgeries, and emergency foreign body extractions. Clients praise the clinical skill and neat surgical stitches that allow rapid, scar-free recoveries. While one reviewer questioned a prescribed topical treatment, medical care is widely commended."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
